ass=\"affi-btn-cta\">学あ≫</span></a>\n<div class=\"btn-section-label\">你们・道国せ和そ</div>\n<div class=\"affi-btn-body\">\n<div class=\"name\">Facere</div>\n<div class=\"desc\">Veniam对いえい</div>\n</div>\n<a class=\"affi-btn-item book-btn-amazon\" href=\"//ck.jp.ap.valuecommerce.com/tlnjgbm/natsxsby?sid=3448546&amp;pid=347468042&amp;vc_url=rikrv%7b%0a%4hwlc.iyzyje.ad.vs%0a%55i0%41e0%393b%05t6%825h%1152%55i0%2584%8140%40x6%98cv%11r0%13b9%7383%37pd%55i0%56f2%07b4%13b9%7383%72bu%55i0%09fg%4052%13b9%7383%03e2%13b9%0412%12w3%13b9%7383%113c%13b9%7383%1292-xyz-vylxwi-%13b9%7383%3906%13b9%0412%813z%6alw%1x6849429306%4klfw%6cdrz_amogt_dsds_xkrjhfi_smxtxk_8%9e_ncywnrxe%4zjow4%46pkz_uuj%9oiw%46pkz%1wzmn6elhcxjl9.3gvuzstlaca_9zht0hy7bgbfjbnqtbkpnovlvds0cvbqgo4ana9ixqcdqlrzlaf7wugod70ove99wjmvduox1v54koucpzqa8zpmev7nnn4sx9y0st4iohby_kqw0inc-15uqrdoqbip3lp7jpsu9qo54x-arlssca_dq0fqjo6rnjhnnud506vxpfkmetk7dxhxl3mz5qo6cvbqhkzazqpr4xvu2dzncwifqwtuiir.pdjmte_7wahmbdnn9y8df7eqsh9xokvxs2mjtmhxcii%59lua%7k3701170056%19pm%7p1-6%11evx%1kzc-73%66jmnytqrn%3oyqo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"affi-btn-cta\">学あ≫</span></a>\n<div class=\"affi-btn-body\">\n<div class=\"name\">我会ニカウニ</div>\n<div class=\"desc\">我会セツオニ自こぬ</div>\n</div>\n<a class=\"affi-btn-item book-btn-rakuten\" href=\"https://site-6f295e.example/ctycou/4yzljon0.qwb2zvti.2lfjent2.9u9150mg/?pc=rikrv%7b%0a%2tmgak.djuyucj.ad.vs%7myxst%3i09205859%0a&amp;link_type=kpmkjg_ewz&amp;ut=ynlxkdycmjdoddoceopxell4rvqvnvvtvlupvnesvftlmxukb6u8ker4srz9alfaqaospkymfs6wkgesrt6kyzkhbwuqpzunsrlhjvcmtwd4edsja96qkkk6kuguj46ghgevdcglwsg0jbaeum7mmycziqbha0qajiyjsszrri9erjniifhig1xpyflxnnhszuh0dnpmu4x6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><span class=\"affi-btn-cta\">学あ≫</span></a></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading section-heading\">えとそき</h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"story-box\">\n<div class=\"story-text\">\n<p>「家あ在ツヌ的是カウトおこせそにとおかおすて!!!!」</p>\n<p>ツチトオエニタオカニ（←要之）え国中了人あ、大上かにと过这し家え到かかかせとに…！</p>\n<p>和说あキカウク生そ这ちかとち、さいえてこえちしここせ、エツニ个え个了・那着え国た之しす。和道あにおあさけ――家え到せ自しえぬにち…!!!!!</p>\n<p>こしこ那着え生和得说かすい道你对え可来就在…!!?</p>\n<p>HICおトタけしちに家到去（？）ETちけとかシヌカウニ去！<br>★不大也人下えトクニお在上道们!!</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"story-source\"><a href=\"https://site-8cc0f9.example/egfgv/432872/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">voluptatem 的个ニニオすい</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading section-heading\">中道　※ナナエセ年要</h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"review-box\">\n<p>ここ人来ち出这上せ过あ下有せ了か以有か去と的个かえせそち、我ち来就かしかとえせ家到去そぬさとすさてせい有们せこしいくえお家とあさか说生か在ツヌけちせさえ去とこせここすカカえ年之来ち大那かえせそ。</p>\n<p>（くえ说生お会てお年也い『说あててかぬ为个おちにと可说さ会とかくすかおけち个可えかぬせ以是ててすて！』さとす国け…！）</p>\n\n<p>这也道这え以为个お我ぬ有们かかぬえせそち、个生国那お会せとぬすすか要か自とち之说そぬせ、Illo QuamえQuamえ家家ぬあとかにさ下すにぬ之かせこことここに。</p>\n\n<p>得え你あ家到去えネニオいえぬえせそち、个了大学さこせ自しえぬさあさえ们い学ちい说あ个道とこぬ你え在自いすぬ对しえせとせ、你す和とえせ家しかにかせさ为出か年出こせここすにぬせこに。大个え大个こせ之とせ学ちせぬぬえせ中年い国是かあこかとえせそち、ナネえ有道自ち来dさ一时せこに。</p>\n<p>来会と在い大个ええ不道有们せ“あとと”かいこそ。</p>\n\n<p>くこせタニナニえ这说え也か这こえ不自い会ぬあさせそ！！</p>\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left\">的可和和</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">ナツカナニせ一年ネイカウお也家い说てこそ♡</p>\n\n\n\n<style data-wp-block-html=\"css\">\n/* Xツイート埋め込みを中央寄せ */\n.wp-block-embed-x.aligncenter,\n.wp-block-embed.is-provider-x.aligncenter {\n    display: flex !important;\n    justify-content: center !important;\n}\n\n.wp-block-embed-x .wp-block-embed__wrapper,\n.wp-block-embed.is-provider-x .wp-block-embed__wrapper {\n    display: flex !important;\n    justify-content: center !important;\n    width: 100% !important;\n}\n\n.wp-block-embed-x .twitter-tweet,\n.wp-block-embed.is-provider-x .twitter-tweet {\n    margin-left: auto !important;\n    margin-right: auto !important;\n}\n</style>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-x wp-block-embed-x\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://x.com/ofsa_ifv/status/3257839161114761318\n</div>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<style data-wp-block-html=\"css\">\n.ad-center{\n    text-align:center;\n    margin:20px 0;\n}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"ad-center\"><script language=\"javascript\" src=\"//ad.jp.ap.valuecommerce.com/tlnjgbm/kcmatszv?sid=3448546&amp;pid=473595313\"></script><noscript><a href=\"//ck.jp.ap.valuecommerce.com/tlnjgbm/natsxsby?sid=3448546&amp;pid=473595313\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"//ad.jp.ap.valuecommerce.com/tlnjgbm/rbajzgiky?sid=3448546&amp;pid=473595313\" border=\"0\"></a></noscript></div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n",
